  "en": "R290 refrigerant, ODP=0, low GWP(GWP=3) [[0|Dual DC Inverter Technology:]]Delivers precise and efficient heating with a maximum output temperature of 78°C. [[0|Top Efficiency Ratings:]]Achieves ErP Level A+++ (at 35°C) with a high COP of 5.62. [[0|Built-in Wi-Fi Module:]]Provides seamless connectivity and control. [[0|Multilingual Support:]] Easy operation in various languages. [[0|SG Smart Grid Functionality:]] Enhances energy management and integration. [[0|Automatic Temperature Adjustment:]] Ensures optimal performance. [[0|Night Operation Mode:]]Convenient control during off-hours. [[0|Cascade Control:]] Supports up to 8 units for flexible scaling. [[0|Timed High-Temperature Disinfection:]]Ensure the safe and healthy use of hot water. [[0|IoT Cloud Management Platform]] [[0|Customizable Features:]] Options for built-in pumps and Refrigerant leak sensors, as well as external heat source and water tank control."
